  "name": "Home-based Working Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Home-based Working Committee was appointed to consider the effects and future development of home-based working in the UK.</p>\r\n<p>Follow the Committee on <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hlhomeworking.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/home-based-working-committee/\">LinkedIn</a>, or X <a href=\"https://x.com/HLHomeWorking\">(formerly Twitter)</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The report Is working from home working? was publised 13 November 2025. The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-response-to-the-home-based-working-select-committee-report\">Government response</a> was published 26 February 2026 and the report was <a href=\"https://hansard.parliament.uk/lords/2026-06-10/debates/C0CBF296-7DC1-4F39-A91D-57466F01FC10/WorkingFromHome(Home-BasedWorkingCommitteeReport)\">debated</a> 10 June 2026.</p>",
